          "id": "59222630-b6ac-4a16-af85-83a048ada8de",
          "memory": "On September 18, 2026, User and Maya confirmed their 1 p.m. pizza lunch at Rosa's on Oak Street, with Maya running about 5 minutes late due to laundry and a missing shoe and User needing about 20 minutes to slip out of the office, planning for User to grab a table on the new patio and get water first.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "8b93fa69-c497-4215-82dd-15fe7dfff0c2",
          "memory": "On the morning of September 18, 2026, User was stuck in the office dealing with endless emails and barely getting real work done before slipping out for the pizza lunch with Maya.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "87119ea7-f3ea-41a9-bb0c-f6fe323fa4b9",
          "memory": "On September 18, 2026, Maya was working from home, had three morning calls she felt could have been texts, and was doing laundry including putting a load in the dryer while hunting for a missing shoe before lunch.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "253d38e9-0aaf-4169-8885-b5e83755434e",
          "memory": "User watered their houseplants on September 17, 2026, and said on September 18 they already looked less dramatic, marking a plant-parent redemption.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "a664d255-a530-4d38-aca3-0ab8a8a775f7",
          "memory": "As of September 18, 2026, Maya's replacement grocery-store basil was hanging in there after Maya remembered to put it by the window, following the death of her previous basil around September 15.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "8ebe44a3-e717-4538-9925-05018e07ccc2",
          "memory": "On September 18, 2026, Maya said her sister had looked up User's recommended pottery studio and felt the Tuesday instructor's schedule was perfect, with User describing the Tuesday guy as super chill and saying she'll love him.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "b854c61c-dfe8-4ac7-8a90-f8a401448a97",
          "memory": "In the week leading up to September 18, 2026, User made a lopsided bowl in pottery class that turned out even more lopsided but was partly saved by the glaze.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ae7c71d1-0608-4f5f-83f7-80a1c4450fd8",
          "memory": "For the September 18, 2026 lunch at Rosa's, User planned to order salad plus garlic knots for balance to pretend to be healthy, while Maya planned full pepperoni with no regrets, with both treating garlic knots as non-negotiable and User agreeing to check the lunch-special board.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
